          [],
          "Black low-top lace-up casual walking shoes with visible stitched toe panels and a layered sole sidewall. Supplier size labels 39-48; confirm the size chart before ordering. This listing has one Black color option, not separate lining-version SKUs. The supplier shows regular mesh-textured and fleece-textured lining options; specify your lining version, size mix, pair quantity, packaging and destination when enquiring. Listed prices are style references, not a confirmed common price for both lining versions. Confirm the final price for the requested version before ordering. This is an externally sourced supplier style; availability, material composition and dispatch timing are confirmed for each order. Sample and customization feasibility require review before confirmation.",
